Description: tools for stamping and signing PDF files
 pyHanko reads and writes PDF files with PAdES digital signatures,
 including invisible and visible signatures, encryption and signature
 validation.
 .
 This is the version berigna is packaged with (ADR-0013): 0.25.1, the last
 one compatible with the Python libraries of Debian 13 (SPK-05).
